 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ b (lane kit-batch-2005b-20261122), hand-authored from the archived crops. Group 0 = panel 25 (W, 24.3 m) from w03-262 2024-08-29: half-sunk ground of low windows, six French windows on storey 1, nine casements and French windows on storey 2, each placed by bayWindows at its measured centre. Group 1 = panel 17 (W, 7.9 m) from the right of w03-262: the glazed entrance bay. Group 2 = panel 30 (W, 23.9 m) from w04-262L 2021-02-18: the Philarood gable (5.5 m) over the podium. Group 3 = panel 64 (E podium, 49.8 m) from w01-77 2025-09-22. Group 4 = panel 34 (E upper wall over the terrace, 43.1 m) from w01-77L 2019-12-11 (25 deg oblique), French doors onto the terrace and the storey-2 sequence read in order. North and south walls and the courtyards take otherWalls."
 ],
